title: DataOps Pipeline — 8 Stages

flowchart LR
    INGEST[1 Ingestion — HackerNews / arXiv / PubMed] --> VALIDATE[2 Validation — schemas.py Pydantic]
    VALIDATE --> TRANSFORM[3 Transformation — Entity Extraction / SQI / Bloom]
    TRANSFORM --> STORE[4 Catalog — registry.json]
    STORE --> VIZ[5 Visualization — core/visuals.py SVGs]
    VIZ --> RENDER[6 Rendering — generator.py + J2 Templates]
    RENDER --> SERVE[7 Serving — Cloudflare Pages CDN]
    SERVE --> OBSERVE[8 Observability — Build Metrics / Quality Flags]

